---
title: Sponsors
description: "Sponsor Team 1102. See our giving levels, from Novice to Dragon, and the businesses and families who make the team possible."
permalink: /sponsors/
---
<section class="pagehead">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h1>Sponsors</h1>
    <p>Sponsorship pays for parts, tools, event registration, and travel. It also puts your name in front of the students and families of {{ site.region }}.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="teeth teeth--moss" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<section class="band">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="split__head">
      <h2>Our sponsors</h2>
      <p>Thank you to everyone who backs the team.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="wall">
      {% if sponsors.tiers | hasSponsors %}
        {% for t in sponsors.tiers | byMinDesc %}
          {% if t.sponsors.length %}
          <h3>{{ t.name }}</h3>
          <ul>
            {% for s in t.sponsors %}
            <li>
              {% if s.url %}<a href="{{ s.url }}" rel="noopener" target="_blank">{% endif %}
              {% if s.logo %}<img src="{{ ('/assets/img/sponsors/' + s.logo) | url }}" alt="{{ s.name }}" loading="lazy">{% else %}<span class="name">{{ s.name }}</span>{% endif %}
              {% if s.url %}</a>{% endif %}
            </li>
            {% endfor %}
          </ul>
          {% endif %}
        {% endfor %}
      {% else %}
      <div class="empty">
        <h3>This wall is waiting for its first name</h3>
        <p>Every sponsor who joins appears here, with a logo size that grows with their level. Yours could be the first.</p>
        <a class="btn btn--moss" href="{{ links.sponsor }}">Become a sponsor</a>
      </div>
      {% endif %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="band band--black">
  <div class="wrap split">
    <div class="split__head">
      <h2>Giving levels</h2>
      <p>Eight levels, named for the ranks of a wizard's career. Every gift helps, and higher levels appear larger on this site.</p>
    </div>
    <ul class="ladder">
      {% for t in sponsors.tiers | byMinDesc %}
      <li style="--rank: {{ loop.revindex }}">
        <span class="tier">{{ t.name }}</span>
        <span class="range">{{ t.range }}</span>
        <p class="recognition">{{ t.recognition }}</p>
      </li>
      {% endfor %}
    </ul>
  </div>
</section>
<div class="teeth teeth--black" aria-hidden="true"></div>

<section class="band cta">
  <div class="wrap">
    <h2>Become a sponsor</h2>
    <p>Email us to choose a level, or to offer tools, materials, or mentor time instead of a gift.</p>
    <div class="btn-row">
      <a class="btn btn--moss" href="{{ links.sponsor }}">{% if site.donateUrl %}Give now{% else %}Email about sponsoring{% endif %}</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
